Great Door was added in '''Beta 30.0'''. With 3/3 for 6G, its first change was a 1 ATK nerf to 2/3 in '''Beta 35.0'''. Originally, its effect made it summon a random monster from your deck with a cost less than its own. '''Beta 50.1''' made it no longer give other Great Doors (that had their cost reduced, as it can't summon monsters with an equal cost). '''Beta 51.0''' followed that by making the summoned monster be the most expensive possible.
[[File:Great Door (Beta 50.1).png|thumb|204x204px|Beta 50.1]]

